[4.579209, "o", "bookit 2.0.1\r\nnate-wilkins <nate-wilkins@code-null.com>\r\nFast and simple bookmark manager for your operating system.\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n    bookit [OPTIONS] [SUBCOMMAND]\r\n\r\nFLAGS:\r\n    -h, --help       Prints help information\r\n    -V, --version    Prints version information\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n        --config <config>            configuration file to use [env: BOOKIT_CONFIG_PATH=]  [default: ~/.bookit]\r\n        --log-format <log_format>    Logging format [default: simple]  [possible values: simple, context]\r\n        --verbosity <verbosity>      Logging verbosity level [env: BOOKIT_LOG_LEVEL=]  [default: info]  [possible\r\n                                     values: error, warn, info, debug, trace]\r\n\r\nSUBCOMMANDS:\r\n    add            add a new bookmark\r\n    completions    completions\r\n    config         configuration\r\n    delete         delete a bookmark\r\n    edit           edit a bookmark\r\n    help           Prints this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)\r\n    view           view bookmarks\r\n"]
